  questionText: 'Presbycusis is an impairment of hearing due to:'
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: Presbycusis is the age-related hearing loss that typically affects
    high-frequency sounds due to gradual degeneration of the cochlea and auditory
    pathways.
  options:
  - Damage to the cochlea
  - Damage to the semicircular canals
  - Age
  - Smoking
